WEBVTT

00:06:00.242 --> 00:06:03.986
I sometimes respond, and other times
I let the art talk for itself.

00:06:06.187 --> 00:06:09.964
The most annoying thing in the world
is when people want to touch the artwork.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:11.860
But I understand.

00:06:12.822 --> 00:06:14.531
But like a lot of contemporary art,

00:06:14.555 --> 00:06:16.035
many people are dismissive.

00:06:16.059 --> 00:06:17.966
Some people are critical,

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:19.342
others are abusive.

00:06:19.918 --> 00:06:22.809
I think it comes from
the fear of the different --

00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:24.170
the unknown.

00:06:24.194 --> 00:06:26.671
There are so many reactions to what I do,

00:06:26.695 --> 00:06:29.729
and I've just learned
not to take them personally.